&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Skillz&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you want to build, own, and see your impact — join Skillz and level up your career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Skillz is the competition infrastructure platform that powers real-money, skill-based tournaments inside mobile games. We didn&#39;t just enter the competitive gaming market — we invented it. Founded in 2012 by entrepreneur and inventor Andrew Paradise, Skillz built the category from scratch: the patented matchmaking, identity, payments, fraud protection, and developer tools that make fair, real-stakes competition possible at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Skillz hosts billions of casual mobile gaming tournaments for millions of players worldwide and is revolutionizing the gaming industry. By fostering social competition within games, the Skillz platform helps developers build multi-million dollar franchises by enabling real-money activity in their games and providing operational support while connecting players through fair, enjoyable, and meaningful competition.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Today, Skillz is part of FIRY — a global holding company operating at the intersection of gaming, AI-powered performance marketing, and developer infrastructure. Alongside RZR, our AI-driven ad network, and Beamable, our backend and LiveOps platform, Skillz sits at the center of a compounding data flywheel that no standalone competitor can replicate. 800,000+ daily tournaments. $7.5 billion in lifetime prizes paid to players. 90 million registered users.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re a high-conviction team of builders who came from Apple, Amazon, Google, Microsoft, Tesla, X, Roblox, Zynga, Samsung, Lyft, EA, Riot, Nexon, Gameskraft, PlayStation, Unity, Scopely, Tinder, Intel, Deloitte, EY, Twitch, DraftKings, Wynn Resorts, and more. We operate like a startup, hold ourselves to high standards, and move fast with purpose. If you want to work on infrastructure that matters — and be part of a team that fights for what it builds — Skillz is the right place.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FIRY Communications Co-Op Rotational Program&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Six-month, in-person program at FIRY headquarters in Las Vegas&amp;nbsp; | &amp;nbsp;Potential full-time conversion to work out of the New York City office if desired (relocation support provided)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eligibility: You must be an enrolled graduate or undergraduate student at the start of the program and graduate no more than 1 year after the program begins&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong performers may be considered for a full-time opportunity at the end of the program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on, 360-degree product marketing and communications co-op reporting to the Head of Communications. You will help shape how Skillz introduces new games and features to players, ensuring each launch tells one clear, compelling story across every touchpoint—including in-app messaging, app store listings, user acquisition creative, email, push notifications, social media, Skillz News, help content, and the website.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own the launch messaging and copy workstream while partnering closely with Product, Marketing, CRM, User Acquisition, and Customer Support. Although channel strategy, audience segmentation, and media buying remain with those teams, you will serve as the connective tissue across them—developing the core positioning, translating it into channel-ready copy, and ensuring every player-facing surface reflects a consistent voice.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The program begins with six months of intensive, in-person development at FIRY&#39;s Las Vegas headquarters. At month five, your performance will be reviewed against transparent conversion criteria. Successful co-ops may be offered a full-time role in FIRY&#39;s New York office, where the position is expected to grow with the company and deepen its connection to the media, agency, financial, and creative communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the messaging and copy workstream for feature and game launches from product planning through post-launch review, including drafting briefs that define the audience, core claim, proof points, and messaging boundaries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build comprehensive launch packages across in-app messaging, app stores, user acquisition creative, lifecycle channels, social media, Skillz News, help content, and the website.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain the launch coverage matrix and conduct readiness checks with Product, User Acquisition, CRM, and Customer Support to ensure every player-facing surface is prepared before release.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce multiple testable copy variations for paid user acquisition campaigns and lifecycle communications across email, push notifications, and in-app messaging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create organic and paid social content, Skillz News stories, and player-facing copy for app store listings, onboarding, tournaments, system messages, help content, and the website.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain the product voice and style guide, use AI tools to increase production speed and variation without compromising quality, and apply channel-performance insights to future launches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Competencies&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product marketing instinct: Finds the claim that matters in a feature spec and can defend why it beats the other three.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Launch orchestration: Tracks a dozen surfaces across four teams against a release date and notices the one nobody covered.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conversion writing: Writes short-form copy that moves a metric, and can articulate why a line works.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Volume with quality: Produces at the rate paid and lifecycle channels require without the tenth variant reading worse than the first.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Voice range: Moves between an ad, an app store listing, a push notification, and a news post while keeping one recognizable product voice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coachability:&amp;nbsp; Takes edit without defensiveness and applies the correction to the next draft. This is the strongest predictor of conversion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently pursuing a Master&#39;s degree in Communications, Public Relations, Journalism, English, Political Science, Marketing, or a closely related discipline with expected graduation in May 2027 or December 2027.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior internship, campus agency, student media, or comparable copywriting experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A portfolio of short-form copy. Ad concepts, social campaigns, email, or spec work all qualify. A campaign carried across multiple channels is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to write multiple distinct executions against a single brief.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working familiarity with A/B testing, click-through rate, and creative fatigue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in or experience with mobile gaming, competitive gaming, or consumer apps preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with AI writing tooling preferred, particularly for variant generation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to relocate to Las Vegas for the co-op term and, if converted, stay in Las Vegas or relocate to New York for the full-time role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Total Starting Compensation: 31/hr (Masters)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Onsite in Las Vegas, NV for 6 months then convert to Hybrid in the NY office.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel Requirement: &lt;/strong&gt;Less than 10%&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Onsite&amp;nbsp; #LI-&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Skillz embraces diversity and is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. As part of our commitment to diversifying our workforce, we do not discriminate on the basis of age, race, sex, gender, gender identity, color, religion, national origin, sexual orientation, marital status, citizenship, veteran status, or disability status, and we operate in compliance with the San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h3 id=&quot;About-the-Role&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c537263f-1174-4957-ad4b-df1bd92f1d78&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;139&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;About the Company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;155&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7df23dd3-3bff-4c14-ae16-033b84af33e5&quot;&gt;If you want to build, develop, and see your impact, join Skillz and level up your Career!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;246&quot; data-local-id=&quot;fac57c29-4c9f-4dbd-9802-c8872f2e3642&quot;&gt;Skillz, the first publicly-traded mobile eSports platform that hosts billions of casual mobile gaming tournaments for millions of players worldwide, is revolutionizing the gaming industry. By fostering social competition within games, the Skillz platform helps developers build multi-million dollar franchises by enabling real-money activity in their games and providing operational support while connecting players through fair, enjoyable, and meaningful competition.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;716&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6a04e1e7-37fb-485f-8de3-c1eb43081085&quot;&gt;At Skillz, we understand the thrill of achievement and the satisfaction of overcoming challenges. Want to join a team made up of alums from Apple, Amazon, Google, Microsoft, Tesla, Twitter (X), Roblox, Zynga, Samsung, Lyft, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_kqswh2mm&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_5pioz8co _189e1dm9 _1il9buyh _19lc184f _d0altlke&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;EA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, Riot, Nexon, Gameskraft, PlayStation, Unity, Scopely, Tinder, Intel, Deloitte, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_kqswh2mm&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_5pioz8co _189e1dm9 _1il9buyh _19lc184f _d0altlke&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;EY&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, Twitch, DraftKings, Wynn Resorts and more? Learn more to see if Skillz is the right fit for your next career move!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1143&quot; data-local-id=&quot;95101ecb-ea9c-491e-9f5e-c4dbc1c5fa39&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Why Skillz&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e89ff20a-fdaa-4b5a-ba14-61ba1540fc02&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1157&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5bb190d7-494d-4bbc-9119-83eaa1202045&quot;&gt;Culture of Impact: Join a united team of builders, creators, innovators, and entrepreneurs driven by the desire to win. At Skillz, we create value, obsess over our product, and make a difference in the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1369&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a98c0062-2d80-46d1-a54c-35df2a50e681&quot;&gt;Comprehensive Benefits: Enjoy peace of mind with our comprehensive benefits package, which includes 100% coverage for medical, dental, and vision expenses for both you and your dependents. Additionally, take advantage of our 401K matching, equity incentives, pre-tax benefit options, and more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1666&quot; data-local-id=&quot;32d9b698-1a1a-4411-a3f0-760b7ecb97b1&quot;&gt;Wellness Support: Enhance your well-being with our array of wellness initiatives, including meditation and mental health resources, physical fitness coaching and classes, family planning assistance, health and parenting guidance, virtual therapy sessions, and more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1935&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c5b370d6-3428-422e-ab10-77feaa352a8b&quot;&gt;Time off: We offer competitive paid time off (PTO) &amp;amp; company holidays to help you recharge and pursue your passions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2123&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b7de23a4-d2d9-4f46-8f40-c47f59015f32&quot;&gt;Las Vegas Headquarters: Skillz strongly believes in a five-day a week, collaborative office environment at our 36,000+ square foot headquarters. Enjoy free breakfast and catered lunches, snacks, a full-size gym with showers, commuter benefits, insurance, team bonding events and many more.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2420&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f73f6e35-d7bf-4c79-b376-9db23e70b46a&quot;&gt;Recognized Success: Skillz has earned recognition as one of Fast Company&#39;s Most Innovative Companies, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_kqswh2mm&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_5pioz8co _189e1dm9 _1il9buyh _19lc184f _d0altlke&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;CNBC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#39;s Disruptor 50, San Francisco Business Times&#39; Best Places to Work, Forbes&#39; Next Billion-Dollar Startups, and the #1 fastest-growing company in America on the Inc. 5000 list, and many more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2719&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6a69b52c-9e4a-489d-9b6e-fe4ad20ab9d8&quot;&gt;Development Opportunities: We hold our employees to high standards while providing them with professional growth opportunities. We operate like a startup, and encourage all of our employees to collaborate and voice feedback about our product and ways we can improve as a business. We believe in never settling, and that also pertains to your growth.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3073&quot; data-local-id=&quot;27b6b372-b656-4cc7-b8b5-0181e9f74f92&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3073&quot; data-local-id=&quot;27b6b372-b656-4cc7-b8b5-0181e9f74f92&quot;&gt;As Skillz scales its operations and the business becomes increasingly complex, we are looking for a dedicated Compliance leader to ensure the business meets all applicable regulatory, legal, and risk management requirements. In this role, you will establish and oversee compliance frameworks, manage relationships with regulators, and mitigate legal and financial exposure as we enter new markets and grow our user base. This function is critical to supporting Skillz&#39;s continued growth and ensuring we operate with the highest standards of integrity as we expand.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3073&quot; data-local-id=&quot;27b6b372-b656-4cc7-b8b5-0181e9f74f92&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ol&quot; data-local-id=&quot;908a5b44-6134-4eaf-8474-d04dd80968b7&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5163&quot; data-local-id=&quot;588c72a9ad0c&quot;&gt;Establish and operationalize a dedicated gaming compliance function, building the policies, processes, and infrastructure needed to support our business lines at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5336&quot; data-local-id=&quot;20b05bb1b380&quot;&gt;Lead end-to-end promotional compliance across all active and upcoming consumer-facing programs, including state registration and bonding, official rules development, eligibility enforcement, and prize fulfillment oversight.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5563&quot; data-local-id=&quot;71e4a6d27977&quot;&gt;Own and maintain a company-wide compliance calendar, risk register, and incident escalation playbook, ensuring zero missed regulatory deadlines and full visibility into the company&#39;s compliance posture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5769&quot; data-local-id=&quot;85a1d5e36986&quot;&gt;Design and enforce a pre-launch compliance review gate for all new programs and product features with a compliance surface area, partnering cross-functionally with Product, Marketing, and Legal to embed compliance into the launch process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6011&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8a63ee82fd49&quot;&gt;Monitor the regulatory landscape across relevant jurisdictions, proactively identify rule changes impacting our operations, and lead remediation efforts before effective dates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3167&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5b102d9a-5e75-40b3-8f1e-45cd596bc5b8&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Key Competencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ol&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b74890a0-e7e6-455d-a266-077d60c287fc&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6212&quot; data-local-id=&quot;145bf198b6cd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Regulatory Expertise&lt;/strong&gt;: Deep knowledge of gaming regulation, gaming promotions compliance, and/or skill-gaming regulations across U.S. jurisdictions, with the ability to translate legal complexity into operational practice.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6430&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6f20cbf5c937&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Builder Mindset&lt;/strong&gt;: Comfortable operating in ambiguity, building structure where none exists, and making sound decisions without fully formed processes or precedent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6596&quot; data-local-id=&quot;46e4e9d6c33e&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Cross-Functional Influence&lt;/strong&gt;: Able to drive compliance adoption across Product, Marketing, and Operations without direct authority, balancing rigor with business enablement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6771&quot; data-local-id=&quot;bd82849f045b&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Risk Judgment&lt;/strong&gt;: Strong ability to assess, prioritize, and communicate compliance risk to senior stakeholders, distinguishing between critical exposure and manageable risk.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6945&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6cee428ffcd5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;People Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Track record of hiring, developing, and managing compliance professionals, with the ability to build a high-performing team from the ground up.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3223&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a23dc508-14fb-4086-b941-61fe1a2afdb5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ol&quot; data-local-id=&quot;2705b553-a645-476b-8840-0cc4b56887ba&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7129&quot; data-local-id=&quot;20d5bef2bd83&quot;&gt;At least 10 years of experience in compliance, regulatory affairs, or a related legal/operations discipline, with direct exposure to gaming promotions, consumer gaming, or consumer-facing regulatory compliance within gaming industry required.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7345&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e2e211afd789&quot;&gt;At least 5 years of people management experience, including hiring and developing team members at varying levels.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7462&quot; data-local-id=&quot;efc1d49bf2c8&quot;&gt;Demonstrated experience establishing and operationalizing a compliance function, including policy development, process infrastructure, and cross-functional program rollout, at a startup or high-growth company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7675&quot; data-local-id=&quot;631bef649f25&quot;&gt;Proven ability to operate as both a strategic leader and a hands-on practitioner, setting long-term compliance direction while personally executing on foundational work in the near term.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3335&quot; data-local-id=&quot;10cc0f3b-5307-4284-8eee-657f72659163&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Total Starting Compensation including Base + Bonus: &lt;/strong&gt;$167,000&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3335&quot; data-local-id=&quot;10cc0f3b-5307-4284-8eee-657f72659163&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;fabric-background-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-background-custom-color=&quot;#fedec8&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;background-color-padding-left background-color-padding-right&quot;&gt;onsite, Las Vegas, NV&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3417&quot; data-local-id=&quot;017e4801-b93a-4b71-be5f-ddf3dd79aee5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Travel Requirement: &lt;/strong&gt;Less than 10%&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
