&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;9727&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7e8aa9d0ca52&quot;&gt;Observability stack ownership — Datadog, Prometheus, distributed tracing (Jaeger/X-Ray), log aggregation&lt;/p&gt;
