&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;9921&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1379476dd168&quot;&gt;Strong distributed systems fundamentals — failure mode analysis, SLO design, capacity planning&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;10019&quot; data-local-id=&quot;59d7c4fd993f&quot;&gt;Security and compliance fluency — PCI DSS, SOX controls, application security architecture&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;10113&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f50ccb631194&quot;&gt;Leadership across global teams — asynchronous communication, on-call design, hiring across time zones&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;10218&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7e1728e1db83&quot;&gt;Demonstrated cost optimisation track record with measurable cloud spend outcomes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;10302&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ad7a77b54a6b&quot;&gt;Clear communication with the executive and cross-functional stakeholders&lt;/p&gt;
