&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;10473&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ee01d042eaef&quot;&gt;5+ years running Kubernetes workloads in production (EKS preferred)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;10544&quot; data-local-id=&quot;215ae27639be&quot;&gt;Proven track record in building or overhauling observability stacks for large-scale distributed systems&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;10651&quot; data-local-id=&quot;4be03afcb2c1&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with CI/CD frameworks (ArgoCD, GitHub Actions, or equivalent)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;10736&quot; data-local-id=&quot;48b8d150b4cb&quot;&gt;Track record leading infra reliability initiatives with measurable, quantified outcomes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;10827&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3f6bc8f15a94&quot;&gt;Comfortable debugging complex distributed systems and reading application code in Go, Python, or Java&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;10932&quot; data-local-id=&quot;aa2eb52c8212&quot;&gt;Prior budget ownership or Opex accountability preferred&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;10991&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e568d90563f1&quot;&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills in English, with the ability to effectively engage and influence senior leadership stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
