&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;11141&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1a43447abbad&quot;&gt;Nice to have&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0e3436ee-74f6-4d71-bbd1-ed0a0ab59ffe&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;11157&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c295ed091e45&quot;&gt;Gaming or fintech experience (real-money, regulated environment preferred)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;11235&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8e736d871488&quot;&gt;Experience working with geographically distributed engineering teams&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;11307&quot; data-local-id=&quot;2dd88ed93132&quot;&gt;Experience building 0→1 teams or standing up functions from scratch&lt;/p&gt;
