&lt;div id=&quot;reading-aids-portal-container&quot; class=&quot;_1reoewfl _18m9ewfl _kqswh2mm _1pby1o8a&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;cc-reading-aids-highlight-spotlight&quot; class=&quot;_tzy4idpf _kqswstnw _lcxvglyw _154i1ter _1ltv1rza _1bsb1rkg _4t3i1474&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Skillz embraces diversity and is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. As part of our commitment to diversifying our workforce, we do not discriminate on the basis of age, race, sex, gender, gender identity, color, religion, national origin, sexual orientation, marital status, citizenship, veteran status, or disability status, and we operate in compliance with the San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Are you passionate about innovation, gaming, and pushing the boundaries of technology? Skillz is always looking for talented individuals to join our team and help us shape the future of competitive gaming and esports.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Even if we have no current openings matching your skills and experience, we encourage you to submit your resume and information to our talent pool. By doing so, you&#39;ll be among the first to be considered when new opportunities arise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here&#39;s what we&#39;re looking for in potential candidates:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion: A genuine enthusiasm for gaming, technology, and our mission to make gaming more inclusive and engaging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skills: Whether you&#39;re a developer, designer, marketer, data analyst, or have expertise in another area, we&#39;re interested in hearing from talented individuals across various disciplines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience: While experience is valuable, we welcome applications from recent graduates and those looking to transition into the gaming industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team Player: Collaboration is key at Skillz, so we value candidates who thrive in a dynamic, team-oriented environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you&#39;re ready to take the next step in your career and join a company redefining the gaming industry, we want to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please submit your resume outlining your skills and experience and explaining why you&#39;re excited about the opportunity to join Skillz. We&#39;ll review your information and reach out when suitable positions become available.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thank you for considering Skillz as your next career destination. We look forward to welcoming you to our team in the future!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;More about Skillz&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Skillz, we believe everyone is born with unique skills and deserves to experience an epic win. We understand the thrill of achievement and the satisfaction of overcoming challenges. That&#39;s why we passionately champion game developers and players alike, empowering them to unleash their full potential through the power of competition.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life @ Skillz&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Culture of Impact: Join a united team of builders, creators, innovators, and entrepreneurs driven by the desire to win. At Skillz, we create value and make a difference in the world.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive Benefits: We value our team members and provide a comprehensive benefits package to ensure your well-being. Enjoy 401K matching, equity incentives, extensive medical, dental, and vision coverage, pre-tax benefit options, and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work-Life Balance: Achieving work-life balance is important to us. We offer competitive paid time off (PTO) &amp;amp; company holidays to help you recharge and pursue your passions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perks: We believe in enhancing your work experience. Enjoy daily breakfast/lunch/dinner + snacks, Friday Happy Hours, commuter benefits, insurance, and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Skillz?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pioneers of Skill-Based Competition: Skillz is not just any company in the gaming industry; we are the pioneer of skill-based competition. Join us in transforming how people play games and building the home of competition for all.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Impact Beyond Gaming: Skillz harnesses the power of its platform to support nonprofit organizations such as the American Red Cross, Susan G. Komen, the American Cancer Society, the NAACP, and more. By participating in Skillz tournaments, you can make a difference and contribute to causes you care about.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recognized Success: Skillz has earned recognition as one of Fast Company&#39;s Most Innovative Companies, CNBC&#39;s Disruptor 50, San Francisco Business Times&#39; Best Places to Work, Forbes&#39; Next Billion-Dollar Startups, and the #1 fastest-growing company in America on the Inc. 5000 list, and many more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Talent Magnet: Join a team of talented professionals passionate about their work. Our team includes experts from Meta, Apple, Amazon, Google, Microsoft, Twitter, Roblox, Samsung, EA, Riot, Tinder, Intel, Twitch, and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Future of Gaming Awaits!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The gaming industry is larger than movies, music, and books, with over 3 billion active gamers playing monthly and over 25 million active developers worldwide. Mobile gaming, in particular, is the fastest-growing segment, projected to reach $300 billion by 2025. At Skillz, you can be at the forefront of this exciting industry and shape its future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/uptd8zrFsLU?feature=shared&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/mCdFJpn3YZA&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Skillz embraces diversity and is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. As part of our commitment to diversifying our workforce, we do not discriminate on the basis of age, race, sex, gender, gender identity, color, religion, national origin, sexual orientation, marital status, citizenship, veteran status, or disability status, and we operate in compliance with the San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Skillz&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you want to build, own, and see your impact — join Skillz and level up your career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Skillz is the competition infrastructure platform that powers real-money, skill-based tournaments inside mobile games. We didn&#39;t just enter the competitive gaming market — we invented it. Founded in 2012 by entrepreneur and inventor Andrew Paradise, Skillz built the category from scratch: the patented matchmaking, identity, payments, fraud protection, and developer tools that make fair, real-stakes competition possible at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Skillz hosts billions of casual mobile gaming tournaments for millions of players worldwide and is revolutionizing the gaming industry. By fostering social competition within games, the Skillz platform helps developers build multi-million dollar franchises by enabling real-money activity in their games and providing operational support while connecting players through fair, enjoyable, and meaningful competition.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Today, Skillz is part of FIRY — a global holding company operating at the intersection of gaming, AI-powered performance marketing, and developer infrastructure. Alongside RZR, our AI-driven ad network, and Beamable, our backend and LiveOps platform, Skillz sits at the center of a compounding data flywheel that no standalone competitor can replicate. 800,000+ daily tournaments. $7.5 billion in lifetime prizes paid to players. 90 million registered users.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re a high-conviction team of builders who came from Apple, Amazon, Google, Microsoft, Tesla, X, Roblox, Zynga, Samsung, Lyft, EA, Riot, Nexon, Gameskraft, PlayStation, Unity, Scopely, Tinder, Intel, Deloitte, EY, Twitch, DraftKings, Wynn Resorts, and more. We operate like a startup, hold ourselves to high standards, and move fast with purpose. If you want to work on infrastructure that matters — and be part of a team that fights for what it builds — Skillz is the right place.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3073&quot; data-local-id=&quot;27b6b372-b656-4cc7-b8b5-0181e9f74f92&quot;&gt;Skillz is looking for a Lead, Consumer &amp;amp; Player Research and Insights to build a deeper understanding of our players and bring their perspectives into critical business decisions. You will lead research across the player experience, translating player needs, motivations, and behaviors into actionable insights that inform product features, promotions, prize structures, and LiveOps. This is a highly cross-functional role that will help teams make more confident, player-centered decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3073&quot; data-local-id=&quot;27b6b372-b656-4cc7-b8b5-0181e9f74f92&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 2;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6113&quot; data-local-id=&quot;632672700099&quot;&gt;Build and lead Skillz’s Consumer and Player Research function, establishing clear intake, prioritization, research standards, and an accessible insights repository.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 2;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6281&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d8fd38a77091&quot;&gt;Design and execute quantitative, qualitative, and mixed-method research to uncover player motivations, pain points, churn drivers, and emerging experience risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 2;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6446&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5db9f9cc6e9c&quot;&gt;Establish a recurring Voice of the Player program, including pulse surveys, player panels, targeted outreach, and segmentation across key player groups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 2;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6602&quot; data-local-id=&quot;4e6515d7399f&quot;&gt;Partner with Product, LiveOps, Analytics, and &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;VIP&lt;/span&gt; teams to validate changes to features, promotions, prize structures, and player economics before launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 2;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6760&quot; data-local-id=&quot;77e70a40a356&quot;&gt;Translate research findings into clear recommendations that influence roadmaps, player-retention strategies, and business decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 2;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6896&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f007d042dd31&quot;&gt;Develop and manage a high-performing research team, setting clear expectations while coaching analysts toward independent execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3167&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5b102d9a-5e75-40b3-8f1e-45cd596bc5b8&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Key Competencies&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 2;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7053&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c8dc2f143e61&quot;&gt;Expertise in consumer insights, player research, UX research, and mixed-method research design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 2;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7152&quot; data-local-id=&quot;000be047f316&quot;&gt;Strong ability to translate player feedback and behavioral data into practical business recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 2;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7260&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ed496bdd7d3a&quot;&gt;Strategic judgment and confidence influencing high-stakes decisions in a fast-moving environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 2;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7361&quot; data-local-id=&quot;998e062b908d&quot;&gt;Cross-functional collaboration with Product, LiveOps, Analytics, Marketing, and customer-facing teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 2;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7467&quot; data-local-id=&quot;62c7c7aefa1c&quot;&gt;Clear executive communication, research storytelling, and stakeholder management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 2;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7552&quot; data-local-id=&quot;34c8d8a3fe6a&quot;&gt;Strong people leadership, coaching, prioritization, and operational discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3223&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a23dc508-14fb-4086-b941-61fe1a2afdb5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 2;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7650&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ef7c47cc140f&quot;&gt;7+ years of experience in consumer insights, player research, UX research, market research, or a related discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 2;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7770&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0b4551117ebc&quot;&gt;Experience building or scaling an insights function, research program, or Voice of the Customer/Player program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 2;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7885&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0a541b32b9fa&quot;&gt;Demonstrated expertise across quantitative and qualitative methods, including surveys, interviews, segmentation, panels, and behavioral analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 2;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;8034&quot; data-local-id=&quot;31a2a615b3c2&quot;&gt;Track record of influencing product, retention, monetization, or customer-experience decisions through research.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 2;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;8150&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5992e16c5734&quot;&gt;Experience managing and developing researchers or analysts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 2;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;8213&quot; data-local-id=&quot;80a8bde4b626&quot;&gt;Gaming, mobile consumer technology, digital entertainment, marketplace, or other high-engagement product experience strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3273&quot; data-local-id=&quot;2f23cfcd-199c-4619-b1d6-b60718c16659&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Total Starting Compensation including Base + Bonus + Equity: &lt;/strong&gt;$160,000&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3335&quot; data-local-id=&quot;10cc0f3b-5307-4284-8eee-657f72659163&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;fabric-background-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-background-custom-color=&quot;#fedec8&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;background-color-padding-left background-color-padding-right&quot;&gt;Onsite, Las Vegas, NV&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Skillz&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re building infrastructure, not just features.&lt;/strong&gt; Skillz is the competition layer for mobile gaming — the matchmaking, payments, identity, and fraud systems that make real-stakes competition trustworthy at scale. The work here compounds. Every improvement to the platform makes every tournament on it better.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Founder-led.&lt;/strong&gt; Andrew Paradise founded Skillz in 2012 with a single conviction: that fair, real-money skill-based competition should exist at scale. Thirteen years later, he’s taken the company public on the NYSE, built a portfolio of three independent businesses, earned 90+ patents, and won the largest false advertising verdict in U.S. history. He is still here — still the founder, still the CEO, still building. That kind of long-term commitment and alignment is rare in any company. At Skillz, it defines the culture from the top down.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Part of a compounding ecosystem.&lt;/strong&gt; Skillz is one of three businesses inside FIRY — alongside RZR, our AI-powered performance ad network, and Beamable, our developer backend platform. Your work spans gaming, ad tech, identity, payments, and ecommerce. The platform you build on gets smarter and more valuable with every player, developer, and advertiser that enters the ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comprehensive Benefits.&lt;/strong&gt; 100% coverage for medical, dental, and vision for you and your dependents. 401K matching, equity incentives, pre-tax benefit options, and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wellness Support.&lt;/strong&gt; Meditation and mental health resources, physical fitness coaching and classes, family planning assistance, health and parenting guidance, virtual therapy sessions, and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time Off.&lt;/strong&gt; Competitive PTO and company holidays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Las Vegas Headquarters.&lt;/strong&gt; Skillz operates in a five-day-a-week, collaborative office environment at our 36,000+ square foot Las Vegas HQ. Free daily catered lunch, snacks, a full-size gym with showers, commuter benefits, team events, and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recognized Success.&lt;/strong&gt; Skillz has earned recognition as one of Fast Company&#39;s Most Innovative Companies, CNBC&#39;s Disruptor 50, San Francisco Business Times&#39; Best Places to Work, Forbes&#39; Next Billion-Dollar Startups, and the #1 fastest-growing company in America on the Inc. 5000 list, and many more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join Skillz and Let&#39;s Redefine the Boundaries of Gaming!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Together, we&#39;ll create a world where skill, passion, and innovation thrive. We look forward to having you on board!&lt;/p&gt;
