&lt;div id=&quot;reading-aids-portal-container&quot; class=&quot;_1reoewfl _18m9ewfl _kqswh2mm _1pby1o8a&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;cc-reading-aids-highlight-spotlight&quot; class=&quot;_tzy4idpf _kqswstnw _lcxvglyw _154i1ter _1ltv1rza _1bsb1rkg _4t3i1474&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Onsite &amp;nbsp;#LI-&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Skillz embraces diversity and is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. As part of our commitment to diversifying our workforce, we do not discriminate on the basis of age, race, sex, gender, gender identity, color, religion, national origin, sexual orientation, marital status, citizenship, veteran status, or disability status, and we operate in compliance with the San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Join Skillz and Level Up Your Career!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Are you ready to take your career to the next level? Join Skillz, the first publicly-traded mobile esports platform that hosts billions of casual mobile gaming tournaments for millions of players worldwide. Skillz is revolutionizing the gaming industry, providing the ultimate platform for competitive mobile games. By fostering social competition within games, Skillz empowers developers to create multi-million dollar franchises while connecting players through fair, enjoyable, and meaningful competition.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;At Skillz, we firmly believe that everyone is born with unique skills and deserves to experience an epic win. We understand the thrill of achievement and the satisfaction of overcoming challenges. That&#39;s why we passionately champion game developers and players alike, empowering them to unleash their full potential through the power of competition.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Life @ Skillz&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Culture of Impact: Join a united team of builders, creators, innovators, and entrepreneurs driven by the desire to win. At Skillz, we create value and make a difference in the world.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Comprehensive Benefits: Enjoy peace of mind with our comprehensive benefits package, which includes 100% coverage for medical, dental, and vision expenses for both you and your entire family.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Wellness Support: Enhance your well-being with our array of wellness initiatives, including meditation and mental health resources, physical fitness coaching and classes, family planning assistance, health and parenting guidance, virtual therapy sessions, and more.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Perks: We believe in enhancing your work experience. Enjoy daily breakfast, lunch, dinner, snacks, Friday Happy Hours,&amp;nbsp; insurance, and many more. We also offer competitive paid time off (PTO) &amp;amp; company holidays to help you recharge and pursue your passions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Why Skillz?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Pioneers of Skill-Based Competition: Skillz is not just any company in the gaming industry; we are the pioneers of skill-based competition, partnered with industry titans like UFC, NFL, T-Mobile, Buzztime, while also hosting renowned events like the Game Developer Conference (GDC). Join us in transforming the way people play games and building the home of competition for all.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Impact Beyond Gaming: Skillz harnesses the power of its platform to support nonprofit organizations such as Susan G. Komen, American Cancer Society, the NAACP, and more. By participating in Skillz tournaments, you can make a difference and contribute to causes you care about.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Recognized Success: Skillz has earned recognition as one of Fast Company&#39;s Most Innovative Companies, CNBC&#39;s Disruptor 50, San Francisco Business Times&#39; Best Places to Work, Forbes&#39; Next Billion-Dollar Startups, and the #1 fastest-growing company in America on the Inc. 5000 list, and many more.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Talent Magnet: Join a team of talented professionals who are passionate about what they do. Our team includes experts from Meta, Apple, Amazon, Google, Microsoft, Tesla, Twitter (X), Roblox, Zynga, Samsung, Lyft, EA, Riot, Nexon, Gameskraft, PlayStation, Unity, Scopely, Tinder, Intel, Deloitte, EY, Twitch, DraftKings, and more.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;The Future of Gaming Awaits!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;The gaming industry is larger than movies, music, and books combined, with over 3 billion active gamers playing monthly and over 25 million active developers worldwide. Mobile gaming, in particular, is the fastest-growing segment, projected to reach $300 billion by 2025. At Skillz, you have the opportunity to be at the forefront of this exciting industry and shape its future.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Push notifications, email, and reactivation are Skillz&#39;s fastest available revenue levers. This role owns building the instrumentation, holdout-based measurement, and journey ownership needed to turn owned channels into an accountable, optimized growth engine.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f373950f-3afc-4614-9a96-42742eeb5250&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;10079&quot; data-local-id=&quot;9306de24e353&quot;&gt;Own email, push notification and in-app messaging as a single lifecycle function for Skillz Platform — strategy, calendar, execution and measurement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;10232&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3bfb1f786cb1&quot;&gt;Own reactivation marketing end to end: cohort definition, offer design, ROI gating against held-out controls, step-downs and exclusion rules for perpetual reactivators.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;10404&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b09f514e098b&quot;&gt;Own CleverTap journey design and execution once ownership transfers from Product, and drive onboarding of remaining titles as SDK 26 coverage expands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;10558&quot; data-local-id=&quot;86197f97b93f&quot;&gt;Make every campaign measurable: holdout-audited incremental &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;NGR&lt;/span&gt; per campaign, CTR by channel and game, deliverability, and unsub/opt-out guardrails.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;10710&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5093dd886f8d&quot;&gt;Enforce messaging hygiene — one notification per campaign per player, mutually exclusive segments, contextual interstitial triggers, and segment→campaign attribution so no segment is orphaned.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;10906&quot; data-local-id=&quot;11d9e6a2d6c4&quot;&gt;Design reactivation and win-back offers within the incentive rules: above-30% bonuses reserved for genuine reactivation, framed as rare and limited.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;11058&quot; data-local-id=&quot;013b18318443&quot;&gt;Manage the Email Marketing Manager and build the lifecycle bench.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;11127&quot; data-local-id=&quot;2b4b3f8589bb&quot;&gt;Partner with Analytics for holdout design and reads, Game LiveOps for surface slates, Launch &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;GTM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; for feature adoption campaigns, and Product (Rishabh) for messaging machinery and &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;PN&lt;/span&gt; observability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;11327&quot; data-local-id=&quot;57636d5f6af8&quot;&gt;Report weekly: what was sent, what it earned, what is being retired, and what needs unblocking.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Key Competencies&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6c86be98-f70e-4816-8737-af9691ef868b&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;11447&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b0e35fa1e5ff&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Incrementality-first thinking&lt;/strong&gt; — instinctively asks what the control group did; treats sends, opens and pMAU as inputs rather than results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;11589&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a4ce1cf7eb97&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Lifecycle craft&lt;/strong&gt; — journey design, triggers, frequency capping, suppression logic and deliverability, across push, email and in-app together rather than channel by channel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;11764&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7a0424a0ec6b&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Offer economics&lt;/strong&gt; — understands that a reactivated user arriving on bonus cash can be &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;NGR&lt;/span&gt;-negative, and can defend a step-down against a stakeholder whose reactivation number it depresses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;11954&quot; data-local-id=&quot;85d2cebad7e3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Hands-on tooling&lt;/strong&gt; — configures journeys and segments themselves; can pull their own data in SQL or a BI tool.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;12066&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1500b6b30219&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Player respect&lt;/strong&gt; — treats notification volume as a finite asset and argues for fewer, better sends.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;12167&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c21a16b0b987&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Builds from zero&lt;/strong&gt; — the function, the DL, the runbook and the measurement all need creating; comfortable with that rather than expecting an established machine.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ol&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;12345&quot; data-local-id=&quot;581d36842a3a&quot;&gt;6–10 years in lifecycle / CRM / retention marketing for a consumer mobile product, including &lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;direct ownership of a reactivation or win-back programme&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;12499&quot; data-local-id=&quot;821f3b831c8a&quot;&gt;Deep hands-on experience with a lifecycle platform — &lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;CleverTap strongly preferred&lt;/strong&gt;; Braze, MoEngage, Iterable or WebEngage acceptable — including journey building, segmentation and frequency management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;12704&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0261b6da5426&quot;&gt;Ran holdout-based incrementality measurement on messaging campaigns and can evidence a campaign they killed on the number.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;12830&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c95c2debbe59&quot;&gt;Real-money gaming, online gambling, fantasy sports, fintech or e-commerce with a wallet/deposit economy strongly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;12957&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c9c235e85b1c&quot;&gt;Owned push notification deliverability and opt-in economics, including double-dialogue opt-in patterns and the constraints of iOS re-enablement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;13105&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0ceee016a697&quot;&gt;Comfortable partnering with Product on instrumentation gaps and with Analytics on independent scoring; experience taking over tooling ownership from another function is a plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;fabric-background-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-background-custom-color=&quot;#fedec8&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;background-color-padding-left background-color-padding-right&quot;&gt;Hybrid in Bangalore, India.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Travel Requirement: &lt;/strong&gt;Less than 10%&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;cc-reading-aids-highlight-spotlight&quot; class=&quot;_tzy4idpf _kqswstnw _lcxvglyw _154i1ter _1ltv1rza _1bsb1rkg _4t3i1474&quot; style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;#LI-Onsite &amp;nbsp;#LI-MK1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Skillz embraces diversity and is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. As part of our commitment to diversifying our workforce, we do not discriminate on the basis of age, race, sex, gender, gender identity, color, religion, national origin, sexual orientation, marital status, citizenship, veteran status, or disability status, and we operate in compliance with the San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h3 id=&quot;About-the-Role&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c537263f-1174-4957-ad4b-df1bd92f1d78&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;139&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;About the Company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;155&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7df23dd3-3bff-4c14-ae16-033b84af33e5&quot;&gt;If you want to build, develop, and see your impact, join Skillz and level up your Career!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;246&quot; data-local-id=&quot;fac57c29-4c9f-4dbd-9802-c8872f2e3642&quot;&gt;Skillz, the first publicly-traded mobile eSports platform that hosts billions of casual mobile gaming tournaments for millions of players worldwide, is revolutionizing the gaming industry. By fostering social competition within games, the Skillz platform helps developers build multi-million dollar franchises by enabling real-money activity in their games and providing operational support while connecting players through fair, enjoyable, and meaningful competition.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;716&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6a04e1e7-37fb-485f-8de3-c1eb43081085&quot;&gt;At Skillz, we understand the thrill of achievement and the satisfaction of overcoming challenges. Want to join a team made up of alums from Apple, Amazon, Google, Microsoft, Tesla, Twitter (X), Roblox, Zynga, Samsung, Lyft, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_kqswh2mm&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_5pioz8co _189e1dm9 _1il9buyh _19lc184f _d0altlke&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;EA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, Riot, Nexon, Gameskraft, PlayStation, Unity, Scopely, Tinder, Intel, Deloitte, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_kqswh2mm&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_5pioz8co _189e1dm9 _1il9buyh _19lc184f _d0altlke&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;EY&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, Twitch, DraftKings, Wynn Resorts and more? Learn more to see if Skillz is the right fit for your next career move!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1143&quot; data-local-id=&quot;95101ecb-ea9c-491e-9f5e-c4dbc1c5fa39&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Why Skillz&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e89ff20a-fdaa-4b5a-ba14-61ba1540fc02&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1157&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5bb190d7-494d-4bbc-9119-83eaa1202045&quot;&gt;Culture of Impact: Join a united team of builders, creators, innovators, and entrepreneurs driven by the desire to win. At Skillz, we create value, obsess over our product, and make a difference in the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1369&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a98c0062-2d80-46d1-a54c-35df2a50e681&quot;&gt;Comprehensive Benefits: Enjoy peace of mind with our comprehensive benefits package, which includes 100% coverage for medical, dental, and vision expenses for both you and your dependents. Additionally, take advantage of our 401K matching, equity incentives, pre-tax benefit options, and more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1666&quot; data-local-id=&quot;32d9b698-1a1a-4411-a3f0-760b7ecb97b1&quot;&gt;Wellness Support: Enhance your well-being with our array of wellness initiatives, including meditation and mental health resources, physical fitness coaching and classes, family planning assistance, health and parenting guidance, virtual therapy sessions, and more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1935&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c5b370d6-3428-422e-ab10-77feaa352a8b&quot;&gt;Time off: We offer competitive paid time off (PTO) &amp;amp; company holidays to help you recharge and pursue your passions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2123&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b7de23a4-d2d9-4f46-8f40-c47f59015f32&quot;&gt;Las Vegas Headquarters: Skillz strongly believes in a five-day a week, collaborative office environment at our 36,000+ square foot headquarters. Enjoy free breakfast and catered lunches, snacks, a full-size gym with showers, commuter benefits, insurance, team bonding events and many more.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2420&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f73f6e35-d7bf-4c79-b376-9db23e70b46a&quot;&gt;Recognized Success: Skillz has earned recognition as one of Fast Company&#39;s Most Innovative Companies, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_kqswh2mm&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_5pioz8co _189e1dm9 _1il9buyh _19lc184f _d0altlke&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;CNBC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#39;s Disruptor 50, San Francisco Business Times&#39; Best Places to Work, Forbes&#39; Next Billion-Dollar Startups, and the #1 fastest-growing company in America on the Inc. 5000 list, and many more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2719&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6a69b52c-9e4a-489d-9b6e-fe4ad20ab9d8&quot;&gt;Development Opportunities: We hold our employees to high standards while providing them with professional growth opportunities. We operate like a startup, and encourage all of our employees to collaborate and voice feedback about our product and ways we can improve as a business. We believe in never settling, and that also pertains to your growth.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3073&quot; data-local-id=&quot;27b6b372-b656-4cc7-b8b5-0181e9f74f92&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3073&quot; data-local-id=&quot;27b6b372-b656-4cc7-b8b5-0181e9f74f92&quot;&gt;As Manager of Learning &amp;amp; Development, you will design and scale programs that help employees and leaders grow, perform at their best, and build successful careers. Your work will shape a high-performance culture and drive business impact through stronger capability across the organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3073&quot; data-local-id=&quot;27b6b372-b656-4cc7-b8b5-0181e9f74f92&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 2;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6152&quot; data-local-id=&quot;bc223e9b8621&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Enterprise Learning Strategy &amp;amp; Function Leadership.&lt;/strong&gt; Lead and architect the end-to-end Learning &amp;amp; Development function at Skillz, defining the strategy, operating model, governance, and roadmap aligned to company KPIs. Build and scale a high-performing &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;L&amp;amp;D&lt;/span&gt; team, ensuring clarity of ownership, curriculum standards, and measurable business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 2;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6504&quot; data-local-id=&quot;621f9d3053c8&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Performance Acceleration &amp;amp; Early Career Enablement.&lt;/strong&gt; Drive improvements in employee performance across the lifecycle, accelerating time-to-productivity and strengthening the first 90-day onboarding experience. Design and implement scalable onboarding and manager enablement interventions that measurably improve ramp speed, performance attainment, and retention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 2;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6869&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a7f760c4474c&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Manager Capability &amp;amp; Organizational Effectiveness.&lt;/strong&gt; Elevate manager effectiveness by defining competency frameworks, leading manager development programs, and embedding performance rigor across the organization. Act as both a strategic advisor and hands-on program leader to ensure managers are equipped to drive high performance and accountability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 2;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7221&quot; data-local-id=&quot;fefa01af83bf&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Learning Measurement &amp;amp; Business Impact Accountability.&lt;/strong&gt; Establish a robust learning measurement framework that ties training initiatives to tangible business metrics (performance distribution, retention, productivity, manager effectiveness). Deliver regular executive-level reporting and ensure &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;L&amp;amp;D&lt;/span&gt; investments produce measurable impact across business units.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3167&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5b102d9a-5e75-40b3-8f1e-45cd596bc5b8&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Key Competencies&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 2;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7604&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8f1413e20892&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Strategic &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;L&amp;amp;D&lt;/span&gt; Architecture.&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated ability to design and stand up an enterprise learning function from strategy through execution, aligning development programs to business outcomes in fast-paced, growth-oriented environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 2;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7840&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1d669f43e488&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Business Impact Orientation.&lt;/strong&gt; Strong analytical mindset with the ability to connect learning initiatives to measurable performance, retention, and productivity outcomes. Comfortable partnering with People Operations, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;FP&amp;amp;A&lt;/span&gt;, Analytics, and business leaders to quantify impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 2;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;8117&quot; data-local-id=&quot;12cfd1ffb5b9&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Manager Development &amp;amp; Performance Expertise.&lt;/strong&gt; Deep expertise in performance management, manager enablement, and organizational effectiveness. Ability to coach senior leaders while also designing and deploying scalable training programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 2;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;8356&quot; data-local-id=&quot;25600e357d44&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Change Leadership &amp;amp; Organizational Agility.&lt;/strong&gt; Proven ability to lead change initiatives, influence cross-functional stakeholders, and drive adoption of new programs in startup or scaling environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 2;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;8558&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7c1ea1a179a3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Operational &amp;amp; Tactical Execution.&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on leader who can facilitate training, design curriculum, and build tools when needed, while simultaneously operating at a strategic level. Balances high-level orchestration with detailed program execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 2;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;8808&quot; data-local-id=&quot;09a38c972329&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Team Leadership &amp;amp; Talent Development.&lt;/strong&gt; Experience building and leading high-performing teams, establishing clear performance standards, coaching team members, and ensuring continuity and scalability of core programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 2;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;9027&quot; data-local-id=&quot;dbfa91cb1b0b&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Data-Driven Decision Making.&lt;/strong&gt; Skilled in establishing metrics, dashboards, and reporting structures to monitor learning effectiveness and inform continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3223&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a23dc508-14fb-4086-b941-61fe1a2afdb5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 2;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;9213&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1f1bf8db3482&quot;&gt;10–12 years of progressive experience in Learning &amp;amp; Development, Organizational Development, or Talent Management. Experience building or scaling enterprise learning programs in growth-stage or technology-driven environments preferred but not required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 2;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;9469&quot; data-local-id=&quot;4c8dca42fdae&quot;&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Human Resources, Organizational Psychology, Business Administration, or a related field; or equivalent education and experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 2;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;9622&quot; data-local-id=&quot;be14ab37a6ad&quot;&gt;Prior people management experience, with demonstrated success leading and developing high-performing teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 2;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;9733&quot; data-local-id=&quot;99262264d38e&quot;&gt;Proven experience designing manager development programs, onboarding frameworks, and performance enablement initiatives tied to measurable business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 2;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;9894&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5dba1fa73b81&quot;&gt;Experience working in fast-paced, scaling organizations where both strategic leadership and tactical execution are required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3273&quot; data-local-id=&quot;2f23cfcd-199c-4619-b1d6-b60718c16659&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Total Starting Compensation including Base + Bonus:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;$128,000&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3335&quot; data-local-id=&quot;10cc0f3b-5307-4284-8eee-657f72659163&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;fabric-background-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-background-custom-color=&quot;#fedec8&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;background-color-padding-left background-color-padding-right&quot;&gt;Onsite, Las Vegas, NV&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3417&quot; data-local-id=&quot;017e4801-b93a-4b71-be5f-ddf3dd79aee5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Travel Requirement: &lt;/strong&gt;Less than 10%&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
