&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Impact Beyond Gaming: Skillz harnesses the power of its platform to support nonprofit organizations such as Susan G. Komen, American Cancer Society, the NAACP, and more. By participating in Skillz tournaments, you can make a difference and contribute to causes you care about.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
