&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;154&quot;&gt;If you want to build, develop, and see your impact, join Skillz and level up your Career!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;245&quot;&gt;Skillz, the first publicly-traded mobile eSports platform that hosts billions of casual mobile gaming tournaments for millions of players worldwide, is revolutionizing the gaming industry. By fostering social competition within games, the Skillz platform helps developers build multi-million dollar franchises by enabling real-money activity in their games and providing operational support while connecting players through fair, enjoyable, and meaningful competition.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;715&quot;&gt;At Skillz, we understand the thrill of achievement and the satisfaction of overcoming challenges. Want to join a team made up of alums from Apple, Amazon, Google, Microsoft, Tesla, Twitter (X), Roblox, Zynga, Samsung, Lyft,&amp;nbsp;&lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_kqswh2mm&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_5pioz8co _189eyh40 _1il9buyh _19lcevot _d0altlke&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;EA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, Riot, Nexon, Gameskraft, PlayStation, Unity, Scopely, Tinder, Intel, Deloitte,&amp;nbsp;&lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_kqswh2mm&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_5pioz8co _189eyh40 _1il9buyh _19lcevot _d0altlke&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;EY&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, Twitch, DraftKings, Wynn Resorts and more? Learn more to see if Skillz is the right fit for your next career move!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;715&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Own:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;55e3535d6106&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;The Senior Software Development Engineer in Test (SDET) role is critical in driving engineering-led quality by ensuring the reliability, scalability, and performance of our products. This role contributes directly to customer experience, release confidence, and overall product stability through strong automation practices and proactive quality ownership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;861a36ac79b6&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;By enhancing test automation coverage, strengthening CI/CD quality gates, and promoting early defect detection, the Senior Software Development Engineer in Test (SDET) directly reduces manual QA effort, production defects, release risk, and engineering rework — translating into lower operational cost, faster release cycles, and more predictable, confident delivery. The role also collaborates closely with developers, product managers, and QA teams to build scalable quality processes and continuously improve engineering efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;
